WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.163
Simmer is a

00:00:00.975 --> 00:00:02.130
tiny Mac menu

00:00:01.942 --> 00:00:02.614
bar app

00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:04.435
Coding agents and

00:00:04.341 --> 00:00:05.720
automated UI tests

00:00:05.532 --> 00:00:06.322
now spin up

00:00:06.133 --> 00:00:07.359
their own simulators

00:00:07.325 --> 00:00:08.279
and often do

00:00:08.091 --> 00:00:08.975
not clean up

00:00:08.799 --> 00:00:09.930
after themselves

00:00:10.462 --> 00:00:11.688
Simmer's menu bar

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:12.926
icon changes color

00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:13.681
by how long

00:00:13.493 --> 00:00:14.612
simulators have been

00:00:14.424 --> 00:00:15.013
open

00:00:15.203 --> 00:00:16.016
on the theory

00:00:15.828 --> 00:00:16.511
that under an

00:00:16.323 --> 00:00:17.655
hour is normal

00:00:17.502 --> 00:00:18.858
and anything longer

00:00:18.670 --> 00:00:20.120
was probably forgotten

00:00:20.654 --> 00:00:21.927
Today I'm releasing

00:00:21.739 --> 00:00:22.281
Simmer

00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:23.189
a menu bar

00:00:23.001 --> 00:00:23.613
app for the

00:00:23.425 --> 00:00:24.781
Mac that monitors

00:00:24.593 --> 00:00:25.889
the simulators running

00:00:25.701 --> 00:00:26.691
on your device

00:00:27.222 --> 00:00:28.236
Full story on

00:00:28.047 --> 00:00:28.943
the dashboard
